Tacy's patch to cloudflared 2026.10.7 (commit 872b241f94871665c1c157adefcf90c11f0ead96), tacy2.

- Every config the edge pushes is refused (orchestration.UpdateConfig): the config pinned in the attested image is
  the only one.
- No management service on the tunnel (no remote log stream, host details or diagnostics: `cloudflared tail` 403).
- No WARP or private-network routing (review M1): every TCP stream from the edge (HTTP/2 TypeTCP and QUIC both call
  proxy.ProxyTCP) is refused before anything is dialed; the WARP origin dialer (TCP, the UDP sessions of datagram v2
  and v3, the virtual DNS service) dials nothing; there is no ICMP proxy. Unconditional: no local or remote config
  turns them on.
- Tests (not in the binary): go test -run Tacy ./proxy ./ingress ./orchestration ./cmd/cloudflared/tunnel

